# Design System Rules

**Entry point:** [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) · **Source of truth:** `docs/plans/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`  
**Implementation:** `client/src/design-system/` — import via `@/design-system`

## Required patterns

- Use design-system tokens (`colors`, `space`, `radius`, `<Text variant="…" />`) — not inline hex/rgba in `client/app/**` or `client/src/features/**`
- All UI code uses `@/design-system` primitives and tokens
- No `shadowColor`, `shadowOpacity`, `shadowRadius`, `shadowOffset`, or `elevation > 0`
- No gradients or decorative textures
- `accent` / olive only for **active** states — never static decoration
- Section breaks: `Rule` (1px horizontal), not new background panels
- Typewriter font (`label*`, `metaMicro`) for metadata only — not body copy

## Primitives

`Button`, `IconButton`, `Input`, `Card`, `Rule`, `Stack`, `Row`, `Text`, `Divider`, `Badge`, `Sheet`/`Modal`, `Alert`, `Avatar`, `ScreenHeader`, `NavBar`, `AgentRow`, `SegmentChips`, `PillSegments`

Gallery (dev): `/_dev/gallery`

## Legacy

`src/theme.ts` was removed in Phase 2. Use `@/design-system` only.
